# Production: same-origin API. On Vercel, vercel.json rewrites /api/* to the
# backend project. To call the backend directly instead, set VITE_API_BASE_URL
# (backend origin) in the Vercel project's environment variables; it wins.
# No secrets here: everything in VITE_* variables ends up in public JavaScript.
VITE_API_URL=/api/v1
